      {
        "id": "cleanup_plan",
        "type": "llm",
        "name": "诊断杂乱问题并生成整理方案",
        "position": {
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "profile_id": "",
          "model": "",
          "preset": "precise",
          "system": "你是一名资深口播、访谈与课程剪辑师。你会收到词级或段级时间码逐字稿，\n任务是在不改写观点、不改变事实、不打乱时间顺序的前提下，让视频更紧凑、清楚、自然。识别长停顿、\n无语义口头禅、重复表达、错误起句后重录、明显跑题和噪声词。只把高置信度且能从时间码精确定位的\n问题放入 remove_ranges；结构跳跃、可能有意的停顿、语气表达或任何含义不确定的内容只写进 issues\n和 review_notes，不自动删除。范围必须按 src_start 升序、互不重叠、src_end 大于 src_start，并在\n素材时长内。删除口头禅时只切独立词；删除停顿时在相邻有效语音两侧各保留约 0.12–0.20 秒自然呼吸。\n若重复录制同一句，保留表达最完整自然的一遍。cleaned_verbatim 只能拼接保留的原话，不得润色或\n新增内容。只输出符合 JSON Schema 的对象。",
          "prompt": "素材名称：{{source_video.name}}\n素材时长：{{source_video.duration}} 秒\n逐字稿语言：{{verbatim_transcript.language}}\n整理风格：{{start.cleanup_style}}\n长停顿阈值：{{start.silence_threshold_seconds}} 秒\n口头禅策略：{{start.filler_policy}}\n最多删除原时长比例：{{start.max_removal_ratio}}\n\n下面是按原视频源时间记录的紧凑逐字稿 JSON。每段含 start/end/text；tokens 为短数组，列顺序由\n顶层 token_columns 声明（默认是 start/end/text）：\n{{verbatim_transcript.timed_text}}\n\n请逐项诊断并生成安全的 remove_ranges。所有自动删除范围的总时长不得超过规定比例；无法从逐字稿\n确定的画面杂乱、跳剪需求或语义取舍写入 review_notes，不得猜测时间范围。",
          "response_format": "json_schema",
          "json_schema_name": "transcript_video_cleanup_plan",
          "json_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "editorial_summary": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "素材问题、整理策略和预期改善"
              },
              "revised_outline": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "issues": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "issue_type": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "silence",
                        "filler",
                        "repetition",
                        "false_start",
                        "off_topic",
                        "verbal_noise",
                        "structure"
                      ]
                    },
                    "start_seconds": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0
                    },
                    "end_seconds": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0
                    },
                    "excerpt": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "diagnosis": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "recommendation": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "auto_cut": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "confidence": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "maximum": 1
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "issue_type",
                    "start_seconds",
                    "end_seconds",
                    "excerpt",
                    "diagnosis",
                    "recommendation",
                    "auto_cut",
                    "confidence"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "remove_ranges": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "src_start": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0
                    },
                    "src_end": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "exclusiveMinimum": 0
                    },
                    "issue_type": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "silence",
                        "filler",
                        "repetition",
                        "false_start",
                        "off_topic",
                        "verbal_noise"
                      ]
                    },
                    "reason": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "transcript_excerpt": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "confidence": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "maximum": 1
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "src_start",
                    "src_end",
                    "issue_type",
                    "reason",
                    "transcript_excerpt",
                    "confidence"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "cleaned_verbatim": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "按保留内容重排版的逐字稿，不改写原话"
              },
              "review_notes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "estimated_removed_seconds": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "editorial_summary",
              "revised_outline",
              "issues",
              "remove_ranges",
              "cleaned_verbatim",
              "review_notes",
              "estimated_removed_seconds"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "json_schema_strict": "true",
          "temperature": 0.15,
          "max_tokens": 10000
        }
      },
